      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         BATES LANE                                              (north east side) 5/302                                        No. 20 Wellhead Cottage and                                              No.22 Primrose Cottage GV                                           II Pair of attached cottages in L shaped block. C17 altered. Timber framed, with part refronting, infill and addition in C18 brick, some chequer pattern, Wellhead Cottage with diaper pattern. Old tiled roof, central chimney to each wing, modern chimney to S. gable of Wellhead Cottage. 1 gabled dormer to S. roofslope of Primrose Cottage 2-storeys. W. elevation to road has projecting gable of Primrose Cottage on LH. 2 bays of 3-light leaded casements, 2 doors. The RH one Wellhead Cottage with C20 gabled open porch. RH gable has timber framing above tiebeam. N. elevation has timber framing, 2 bays of 2-light leaded casements, lower addition to LH with lower wing attached. Rear elevation of Wellhead Cottage has first floor band and diaper pattern brickwork. Grouped with 3, 4 & 5 Willow End (q.v.) RCHM I p.316. MON.24. Listing NGR: SP8583810765"
    }
  ],
